		"Name": "Warhammer IIIC",
		"Details": "Piloted in the arenas by the mysterious and enigmatic Anthony Truscott (callsign: Blue Mamba), the Warhammer IIIC is an advanced variant of the Warhammer IIC that has been upsized in tonnage to 100 tons. It is equipped with high-powered Clan technology, including a 400-rated Clan XL engine, Clan Endo-Steel bones, and Clan Ferro-Fibrous armor. For firepower it carries a withering array of weaponry, all Clan-grade of course: two ER PPCs, five Medium Pulse Lasers, two ER Small Lasers, two Streak SRM-2s, and two LRM-10s with Artemis IV. To handle the prodigious waste heat from the weapons the Warhammer IIIC carries twenty Clan-grade Double Heat Sinks. The Warhammer IIIC is a dangerous sight to face down, be it in the arenas or on the battlefield.\n\n <b><color=#e51717>COMMUNITY CONTENT</color></b>",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_warhammeriic"
	},
